 R←Test_UC_025(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;result;tempDir;log;files;stop
⍝ Runs ]CompareVersions with -project= pointing to a folder that is NOT an opened project.
⍝ The space is then empty, so the object must be identified - and the versions extracted - in
⍝ that folder: passing on the empty space instead falls back to whatever project happens to be
⍝ open, or asks the user to pick one.\\
⍝ Works on a private copy of the fixture, which nobody opens.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed
 files←⍬
 stop←0

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 (##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/CiderProject4.zip')ZipArchive.UnzipTo tempDir
 log←tempDir G.ChangeLog'APLSource/Counter.aplf'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 3≠≢log

 ⍝ The two most recent commits, passed explicitly: with three of them the user would be asked
 (rc msg result)←stop ∆UCMD'CompareVersions APLSource/Counter.aplf ',((⊂1 1)⊃log),',',((⊂2 1)⊃log),' -project="',tempDir,'" -files'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 files←,result
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠≢files
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∧/⎕NEXISTS files
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/' r←3'⍷⊃⎕NGET 1⊃files
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/' r←2'⍷⊃⎕NGET 2⊃files

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 :If 2=≢files
     {}FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce⊃⎕NPARTS⊃files
 :EndIf
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
